OL,3,GNEWSADemolition and rebuild of WW2 huts
OL,4,Ato get new cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe redevelopment of World War Two
OL,7,Fhuts, one of which is now a theatre, is
OL,8,Fexpected to receive an extra #250,000
OL,9,Fof funding.
OL,11,FMole Valley District Council said the
OL,12,Frepurposed huts in Dorking, Surrey
OL,13,Fwould be demolished and replaced in
OL,14,FJune 2027, if the proposal is
OL,15,Fprogressed by councillors.
OL,17,FAccording to officials, the huts which
OL,18,Fare believed to have been built in the
OL,19,F1940s, located behind Dorking Halls,
OL,20,Fare "no longer suitable for modern
OL,21,Foccupational requirements".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
