OL,3,GNEWSADemolition and rebuild of WW2 huts
OL,4,Ato get new cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planning application to demolish the
OL,7,Fhuts and replace them with five larger
OL,8,Fcommercial units, including one for
OL,9,Ftheatre use, has been submitted.
